  <title>Live regions</title>
  <p>
    Live regions are areas of a web page that update automatically, such as stock tickers,
    weather updates, chat messages, or alerts.
  </p>
  <p>
    Live regions have a politeness level that suggests when assistive technologies should
    present updates. Off requests no announcements, polite requests announcements when other
    speech has finished, and assertive requests immediate announcements. The commands below
    control presentation and navigation.
  </p>
  <section id="live-regions-commands">
    <title>Commands</title>
    <p>
      <em style="strong">Preferences location:</em>
      <gui>Commands</gui> category, <gui>Commands</gui> section, <gui>Structural navigation</gui> group.
    </p>
    <list>
      <item>
        <p>
          <gui>Go to previous live region</gui>: <keyseq>
            <key>Shift</key>
            <key>D</key>
          </keyseq>
        </p>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>
          <gui>Go to next live region</gui>: <keyseq>
            <key>D</key>
          </keyseq>
        </p>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>
          <gui>Go to the last live region which made an announcement</gui>: <keyseq>
            <key>Y</key>
          </keyseq>
        </p>
      </item>
    </list>
    <section id="commands-live-regions">
      <title>Live regions</title>
      <p>
        <em style="strong">Preferences location:</em>
        <gui>Commands</gui> category, <gui>Commands</gui> section, <gui>Live regions</gui> group.
      </p>
      <list>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Monitor live regions</gui>: <keyseq>
              <key>Orca Modifier</key>
              <key>Backslash</key>
            </keyseq>
          </p>
          <p>
            Turns live region support on or off. When enabled, Orca keeps the last nine live
            region messages so you can review them later.
          </p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Advance live region politeness setting</gui>: Unbound by
            default.
          </p>
          <p>
            Cycles through off, polite, and assertive politeness levels for the current live
            region.
          </p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Set default live region politeness level to off</gui>: Unbound by
            default.
          </p>
          <p>
            Turns announcements off for the current page. Use it again to restore announcements.
            It does not change your saved default settings.
          </p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Present previous live region message</gui>: Unbound by
            default.
          </p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Present next live region message</gui>: Unbound by
            default.
          </p>
        </item>
      </list>
    </section>
  </section>
